    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the maze. Defend your base. Tempt the forest.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Greed Forest</i>, you shape the battlefield. Place towers freely to define your own paths \u2014 or leave it open and brace for chaos. Every tower earns experience and levels up through combat, and each can be upgraded with gold and enhanced with unique attack effects to match your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/46e9091c047a222ee210c36dda71646e.poster.avif?t=1751802001\" width=510 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/46e9091c047a222ee210c36dda71646e.webm?t=1751802001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/46e9091c047a222ee210c36dda71646e.mp4?t=1751802001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct gold mines to grow your economy and unlock powerful global upgrades that boost all towers. But beware: as the waves intensify, a powerful boss and their allies will launch a final assault \u2014 turning tower defense into base defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling confident? Place <strong>Temptation Baskets</strong> to provoke more and stronger enemies. It\u2019s a gamble that raises the stakes and your score.  <br><strong>Will you survive long enough to set a record\u2026 or fall to greed \u2014 yours, or that of the forest?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Freeform Tower Placement</strong> \u2013 Design your own maze or leave it open for fast enemy rushes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 <strong>Tower Progression</strong> \u2013 Towers gain XP and level up by killing enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Economic Growth</strong> \u2013 Build gold mines to increase your resource generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Customizable Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Add attack effects per tower and unlock global buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc09 <strong>Boss Assaults</strong> \u2013 Survive late-game invasions that push your defenses to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Spells</strong> \u2013 Help out your towers with powerful spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf<strong>Take Control</strong> - Manually shoot using a strong tower like an FPS.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/a6cc714b8a5420c22144095a2dd13b6b.poster.avif?t=1751802001\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/a6cc714b8a5420c22144095a2dd13b6b.webm?t=1751802001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/a6cc714b8a5420c22144095a2dd13b6b.mp4?t=1751802001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the maze. Defend your base. Tempt the forest.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Greed Forest</i>, you shape the battlefield. Place towers freely to define your own paths \u2014 or leave it open and brace for chaos. Every tower earns experience and levels up through combat, and each can be upgraded with gold and enhanced with unique attack effects to match your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/46e9091c047a222ee210c36dda71646e.poster.avif?t=1751802001\" width=510 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/46e9091c047a222ee210c36dda71646e.webm?t=1751802001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/46e9091c047a222ee210c36dda71646e.mp4?t=1751802001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct gold mines to grow your economy and unlock powerful global upgrades that boost all towers. But beware: as the waves intensify, a powerful boss and their allies will launch a final assault \u2014 turning tower defense into base defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feeling confident? Place <strong>Temptation Baskets</strong> to provoke more and stronger enemies. It\u2019s a gamble that raises the stakes and your score.  <br><strong>Will you survive long enough to set a record\u2026 or fall to greed \u2014 yours, or that of the forest?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Freeform Tower Placement</strong> \u2013 Design your own maze or leave it open for fast enemy rushes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 <strong>Tower Progression</strong> \u2013 Towers gain XP and level up by killing enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 <strong>Economic Growth</strong> \u2013 Build gold mines to increase your resource generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Customizable Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Add attack effects per tower and unlock global buffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc09 <strong>Boss Assaults</strong> \u2013 Survive late-game invasions that push your defenses to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Spells</strong> \u2013 Help out your towers with powerful spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf<strong>Take Control</strong> - Manually shoot using a strong tower like an FPS.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/a6cc714b8a5420c22144095a2dd13b6b.poster.avif?t=1751802001\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/a6cc714b8a5420c22144095a2dd13b6b.webm?t=1751802001\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960760/extras/a6cc714b8a5420c22144095a2dd13b6b.mp4?t=1751802001\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
